{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21023","headline":"神弦曲 · 李贺","name":"神弦曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西山日没东山昏，旋风吹马马踏云。\n画弦素管声浅繁，花裙綷䌨步秋尘。\n桂叶刷风桂坠子，青狸哭血寒狐死。\n古壁彩虬金帖尾，雨工骑入秋潭水。\n百年老鴞成木魅，笑声碧火巢中起。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21023.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21023","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}